        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>瑞吉欧Reggio</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        background-color: #3a3a3a;\n        color: #ffffff;\n        font-family: 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        align-items: center;\n        padding: 50px 20px;\n        margin: 0;\n    }\n    .title {\n        font-size: 48px;\n        font-weight: normal;\n        background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);\n        padding: 10px 30px;\n        margin-bottom: 40px;\n    }\n    .content-block {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        align-items: center;\n        margin-bottom: 25px;\n    }\n    .line {\n        background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);\n        padding: 8px 16px;\n        margin: 4px 0;\n        font-size: 22px;\n        line-height: 1.2;\n        white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .wavy-underline {\n        text-decoration: underline;\n        text-decoration-style: wavy;\n        text-decoration-color: #ffe600;\n        text-decoration-thickness: 4px;\n        text-underline-offset: 6px;\n    }\n    .bullet {\n        margin-right: 8px;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"title\">瑞吉欧Reggio</div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-block\">\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"bullet\">●</span>基于皮亚杰和维果斯基等心理学家的</div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"wavy-underline\">建构主义心理学。</span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-block\">\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"bullet\">●</span><span class=\"wavy-underline\">走进儿童心灵的儿童观，以孩子的思维、</span></div>\n        <div class=\"line\">孩子的立场来看待一场</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">不压制孩子，让其充分表现潜能</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-block\">\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"bullet\">●</span><span class=\"wavy-underline\">弹性课程，从儿童的兴趣和需要出发</span></div>\n        <div class=\"line\">不让孩子生活在成人的包围之中。</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-block\">\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"bullet\">●</span><span class=\"wavy-underline\">教师必须尽可能地减少介入，更不可过度介入。</span></div>\n        <div class=\"line\">与其牵着儿童的手，不如让他们用自己的双脚站立。</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-block\">\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"bullet\">●</span><span class=\"wavy-underline\">儿童的自我表达和相互交流特别重要，是儿童探索、</span></div>\n        <div class=\"line\">研究、解决问题过程中的基本活动。</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-block\">\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"bullet\">●</span><span class=\"wavy-underline\">在共同分享中，每个人均可提出最好的想法，</span></div>\n        <div class=\"line\">提升和加强团队间意见交流、</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">并刺激新奇或出乎意料的事情发生。</div>\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
